  "generated": "---\ntitle: \"Working with incoming calls\"\nslug: \"/apps/ios-incoming-calls--dyme8igul5ou82hhztgphpg1\"\nmdx: {\"format\":\"md\"}\ntags: [\"iOS\",\"General\",\"ios\",\"working-with-calls\"]\n---\n\nUpon receiving an incoming call, on your mobile device, you will see the following screen:\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/c70c9c2a959cfcfd63df/f2b59b71a3ad200c279653aab12f73ecb279c8b0e7da57351f77aa3cef2186f1.png)\n\n1. Drop a call\n2. Answer an incoming call\n\nDuring a call, you have access to the following features:\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/8001350515bfb43c6ac1/370456b7f81981498cab84f2910539b684327d1d440bc7b757a49cc62365b9aa.png)\n\n1. Open Contact’s Profile.\n2. Put the call on hold.\n3. Make a parallel call.\n4. Mute / unmute microphone.\n5. Turn the video on / off.\n6. Turn call recording on / off.\n7. Open the numpad to send DTMF.\n8. Transfer a call.\n9. Turn the speaker on / off.\n10. Open a chat with a caller.\n\n## Related articles\n\n- [Switching between two lines during a call](/docs/apps/ios-switching-between-lines--gley2co2423x5no1xjnoapcj)\n- [Transfer a call](/docs/apps/ios-transfer-a-call--fi98bkz81m665tyvhwu8p13p)\n- [Working with contacts](/docs/apps/ios-working-with-contacts--fkd2qyccst8qw7mnpdkeyppp)\n"
